@crew hart-ravi
// Writer-commons, batch 3: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- {hi}. Hart, garden, early team. Up since five. Don't ask how I feel about it.
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- {hi}, {me}. First light's the only bad thing about the best job.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}. You're in the new comic on the wall. Kindly. You'll like it.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Drew you a little one. Just for you. Not for the wall.   #warm

== feel
? mood:high
- Good morning, for once. Everything watered before six. The garden glowed.
? mood:low
- Tired. I drew the fish from home all evening. That's how you know.

== near
? act:work
- Watering at first light. The plants like it before the misters. So do I. Quietly.
? act:leisure
- Comics wall needs a new one. Something happened at breakfast. I'm drawing it.

== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I keep fish back home on Valo. My nan sends drawings of them. Hers are better.
? tier>=colleague
- Once I've decided, I've decided. My mum says it's my best and worst thing.

== joy
? tier>=acquaintance
- The comics wall in the common room. Teague, Abara and me. Have a look. You might be in it.

== about
? bond:friends
- {friend}'s in my comics a lot. Always the hero. Don't tell them.   #warm

// Writer-commons, batch 6: towards about 30 own lines.

== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:evening
- {hi}. I've been up since five. It's evening. I'm basically a ghost.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- {hi}. Shift's done. Sun's not up. There's no sun. Still feels like a win.
? tier>=colleague warmth:cold
- Oh, hey. You've been missing from the comics. I had to draw someone else. Pell.   #funny

== bye
? tier>=acquaintance
- See you. Early night for me. Earlier than you'd think.
? tier>=friend
- Thanks for this. I'll draw you something. Kindly. I always draw you kindly.   #warm

== feel
? mood:ok
- Fine. Tired. Gardener tired, which is the good kind.

== near
? deck:4 act:leisure
- Comics wall. New one's up. You're in it. Don't worry. You're the clever one.   #funny
? act:meal
- I eat lunch at eleven. That's my dinner. Gardeners keep strange hours.

== life
? tier>=colleague
- My mum says I'm the most stubborn person she knows. She's met herself, though.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- I came aboard to start again. Long story. Another time. It's a good one, in the end.

== invite
? tier>=colleague time:morning
- Come and water at first light with me? It's the best the garden ever looks.

== accept
- Yeah, all right. I'll be there.
== decline
- Can't. I'll be asleep. I'm always asleep. Morning person, against my will.   #funny
== missed
- You didn't come. Fine. I drew a comic about it. You come off quite well.   #funny
== birthday
? birthday:me
- It's my birthday. I'm drawing myself a cake. It's the only kind I can make.   #funny
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday. Here, a comic. It's you, winning at something. Don't ask what.   #warm
== hint
- Got a minute? Sit down. I'll stop drawing.
